BT 1 0 0 1 0 30 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (OBJECTIVE: While considerable attention has focused on improving the detection of depression, assessment of) Tj T* (severity is also important in guiding treatment decisions. Therefore, we examined the validity of a brief, new measure of) Tj T* (depression severity.) Tj T* ET
