BT 1 0 0 1 0 69 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL -0.121919 Tw (MEASUREMENTS: The Patient Health Questionnaire \(PHQ\) is a self-administered version of the PRIME-MD diagnostic) Tj T* 0 Tw (instrument for common mental disorders. The PHQ-9 is the depression module, which scores each of the 9 DSM-IV) Tj T* (criteria as "0" \(not at all\) to "3" \(nearly every day\). The PHQ-9 was completed by 6,000 patients in 8 primary care clinics) Tj T* (and 7 obstetrics-gynecology clinics. Construct validity was assessed using the 20-item Short-Form General Health) Tj T* (Survey, self-reported sick days and clinic visits, and symptom-related difficulty. Criterion validity was assessed against) Tj T* (an independent structured mental health professional \(MHP\) interview in a sample of 580 patients.) Tj T* ET
